        "text_PfVjhH": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p><strong>This Detroit history jewelry collection is made from reclaimed materials pulled from some of the city's most iconic landmarks</strong> Each building has its own story, and the materials from those spaces carry that history forward in a tangible way. The colors and textures in every piece come directly from the source, so what you're wearing is a genuine fragment of Detroit's past. If you're looking for a Detroit gift that actually means something to the person receiving it, this collection is a good place to start.</p><p><strong>Rebel Nell has been handcrafting meaningful jewelry in Detroit since 2013.</strong> Every piece is made by our Creative Designers, women employed through our workforce development program. So your purchase supports both a one-of-a-kind piece of wearable Detroit history and women building better futures right here in the city. Learn more about <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\" title=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/our-story\">our story</a> and read <a href=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\" title=\"https://www.rebelnell.com/pages/reviews-1\">our customer reviews.</a></p>"
          }
